+### User transfer between organizations
+
+- Only an org admin may transfer users, and only for their own organization
+  (`{orgID}` must be the actor's org; another org → 404, a non-admin → 403).
+- The user must belong to `{orgID}` (else 404), and `toOrgId` must be an existing
+  organization different from `{orgID}` (else 400).
+- A user who is still a member of a project in `{orgID}` cannot be transferred
+  (409). Remove the memberships first; a refused transfer changes nothing.
+- After a transfer the user's org admin right is dropped. Admin rights are per
+  organization and do not move with the user.
